  "description": "NoSqlRepository is a flexible and robust implementation of the repository pattern for NoSQL databases.\n            It provides a clean abstraction layer between your domain model and data access logic, with built-in MongoDB support.\n            Features include:\n\n            - Generic repository implementation\n            - MongoDB integration\n            - Async/await-first design\n            - CRUD operations support\n            - Query optimization capabilities",
